    </style>
    <h2>0.10.5</h2>
    <h3>Added</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Gemma 4 E4B is now available as an optional local enhancement model — higher quality, especially for other languages, at a larger download (3.4 GB) and more memory than the default. Download it from Settings → AI Models. The default model stays Gemma 4 E2B.</li>
      <li>The local model picker now shows a short note on what each model is best for.</li>
    </ul>
            ]]></description>
